      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T03:33:05Z",
      "body": "Coordination update: #1529 has merged as `ba266ad44f21c9df2dafa9d56a1e2051c1565d91`; its tree equals independently reviewed head `c1063bf9`, and the operational coordinator has now adopted that policy. The owner directly clarified: **“Keep the transformer-free requirement; conversion must remove the transformer architecture.”** D17 records that answer, a fully partitioned prospective parity rule, transferable claims and the one-use repair (now complete).\n\nThis PR was prepared against the previous main and now overlaps/conflicts with that delivered D17. I am comparing its unique evidence against main before recording a preserved disposition. Please do not enqueue the competing policy text or spend another full policy-review cycle. Retain this head and any unique timeline evidence. The current Claude extended goal is now on main: https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/blob/main/docs/labs/prompts/claude.md . Its first implementation priority is the #1506 saved-snap/D10 corrections, coordinated with Antigravity's exporter work. Current model/storage admission remains subject to the actual runner; stale “SSD detached” notes no longer describe the verified mount.",
